@title EMC design record: PDF and Excel written and kept for inspection
@area Reports
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Check > EMC check has Save EMC record (PDF) and (Excel). The files are written next to the project (the fixture copy in /tmp) and kept so a person can read the real content: findings with what to do at the bench, rules that ran, assumptions, not checked.
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet-door.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc check
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
expect "Save EMC record (PDF)"
shot 00-buttons
check_layout
click_text "Save EMC record (PDF)" #1
wait 20
expect_file "/tmp/kopercad-qa-open-*/*EMC record.pdf" 1500
keep_file "/tmp/kopercad-qa-open-*/*EMC record.pdf"
click_text "Save EMC record (Excel)" #1
wait 20
expect_file "/tmp/kopercad-qa-open-*/*EMC record.xlsx" 1500
keep_file "/tmp/kopercad-qa-open-*/*EMC record.xlsx"
shot 01-written
check_layout
